                     "Soeren Auer"@en,
                     "Christoph Lange"@en;
        dc11:description " SemSur, the Semantic Survey Ontology, is a core ontology for describing individual research problems, approaches, implementations and evaluations in a structured, comparable way."^^rdfs:Literal;
