<http://purl.org/semsur/LIMES_evaluation> semsur:hasExperimentSetup "Every time measurement experiment was carried out as a single thread on a 32-bit system with a 2.5GHz Intel Core Duo CPU and 4GB RAM. For our experiments, we used version 0.3.2 of LIMES and version 2.0 of SILK.";
