<http://purl.org/semsur/SERIMI_evalaution> semsur:hasExperimentSetup "We have loaded all these datasets into an open-source instance of Virtuoso Universal server10, where around 2GB of data were loaded. An exception was the DBPedia dataset, which we accessed online via its Sparql endpoint. The Virtuoso server was installed in a Mac OS X – version 10.5.8, with 2.4 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo processor and with 4 GB 1067 MHz DDR3 of memory. We ran the script that implements the SERIMI approach directly over the local SPARQL endpoints and DBPedia online endpoint.";
