                                                                         <http://purl.org/semsur/Shu_Rong>,
                                                                         <http://purl.org/semsur/Xing_Niu>;
                                                            swrc:abstract "This report presents the results of Zhishi.links, a distributed instance matching system, for this year’s Ontology Alignment Evaluation Initiative (OAEI) campaign. We participate in Data Interlinking track (DI) of IM"@en;
